Thank you once again for your interest in our company. Please find my 
answers to your questions below:

1. Fabrics, yarns and trims

All of our garments are manufactured in Iran using our own production 
facilities. We primarily source fabrics, yarns, and trims from reliable 
domestic suppliers in Iran. However, depending on the customer's 
requirements, product specifications, or desired quality standards, we 
also use carefully selected imported raw materials whenever necessary.

2. Our competitive advantages compared to manufacturers in China and 
Turkey

We believe our main strengths are:

Competitive pricing while maintaining consistent product quality.
Flexible production with the ability to accommodate customer-specific 
requirements.
Lower minimum order quantities compared to many larger manufacturers.
Reliable lead times and on-time delivery.
Personalized communication and customer service throughout the entire 
production process.
The ability to develop customized products and collections according to 
our customers' needs.
Strong experience in manufacturing both knitted and woven garments for 
international markets.

Our goal is to provide our partners with the best balance between 
quality, flexibility, service, and price.

3. Experience with Russian customers

One of our customers in Russia is Dyma LLC (ООО "Дюма"), a Russian 
company specializing in homewear. We have also established business 
relationships with other Russian customers following our participation 
in trade exhibitions in Russia. We highly value our customers' trust and 
therefore keep the details of some of our business relationships 
confidential.

4. Market segment

Our products are mainly positioned in the mid-range market segment, 
offering a balance of quality, design, and competitive pricing.

